  readTime: '5 min read',
  image: 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555066931-4365d14bab8c?w=800',
  content: [
    'React Native has become the go-to framework for building cross-platform mobile applications. With Expo streamlined development experience, creating production-ready apps has never been easier.',
